review_text:
Cannot say enough thank you to Joy. My family is very lucky to have them taking care of our two kids for 4yrs. We know every teacher because their stability which is great. Joy is such a great place that:
Teachers are very nice and pay attention to details of every kid;
Easy to communicate whenever/whatever you need their help(very important for parents);
My kids LOVE their homemade food which is fresh, tasty and healthy(not fast food not canned food). They even ask me to learn how to cook those dishes that they like LOL.
The learning system they have is kind of unique that makes the kids easy to understand and enjoy. Joy has a higher study standard which we like that makes kids transfer to K very easily.
I would say we don't worry about the kids at all once they are in Joy.
